(text "Joint encoders: AS5600 reads a magnet on each joint OUTPUT shaft (after the gearbox), so the angle is absolute at power-up.\nOUT = analog angle (0-5 V) to Mega A0-A4 through 1k + 100 nF at the Mega end. DIR tied to GND sets direction.\nCheck the module runs at 5 V (VCC) before buying; SDA/SCL left free for later I2C use." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 660.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6487bede-12b5-4ad6-bf8c-6d3dd3efe02d))
